<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed higher in moderate trading Monday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 41.18 to 6918.92.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 1.83 to 417.34.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.19.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 1287 to 1211.</p>
<p>Volume was 432,630,900 compared with 508,266,000 on Friday.</p>
